<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (These operations expose employees to a wide range of occupational hazards, including vehicle movements, manual handling activities, loading and offloading operations, working at height, mechanical maintenance, hazardous substances, adverse weather conditions, and extended periods of work in high-risk environments. Effective workplace safety therefore requires more than compliance with safety regulations, it requires appropriate Personal Protective Equipment \(PPE\) that is suited to the specific tasks performed by employees.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
